WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.917
Find your kind of place

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:16.500
Have a place to rent out?

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:26.125
Bring your existing rental

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:35.417
Connect with your renter

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:43.208
Now, the renter’s side

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:51.625
Create the monthly bill

00:00:51.625 --> 00:01:01.833
Paid the owner? Record it here.

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:12.458
A report still needs checking

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:22.167
Check it. Then confirm.

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:30.792
Cash works too

00:01:30.792 --> 00:01:40.542
Keep the full story

00:01:40.542 --> 00:01:50.083
Both sides, on the same page
